meow wolf is an art collective turned  production company ultimately it's a  social  impact art project this exhibition here  at area 15  is basically an immersive experience  that begins  in this grocery store omega mart as you  move through the store you'll find this  is  absolutely not your typical grocery  store  eventually you'll probably find your way  into some portals  into a parallel dimension when you move  into that  parallel dimension there are art  installations from artists from  all over the world that are on display  it's sort of like walking through  a series of dreams we've gotten to work  with  dozens of really brilliant local artists  and a lot of their work is on display  here  in omegamart they all kind of merge and  blend together in different ways it's  really hard to say where one thing stops  and another  begins this is the culmination of 13  years of work for me personally and for  my my fellow uh co-founders and the  meowthers that have been  involved from the from day one we have  tickets on sale right now  at omegamart.com tickets are yeah start  at 45 dollars  and we have a local discount for anybody  that lives in the area
 

